 where he advances partnerships with U.S. institutions and identifies opportunities for joint academic, research, and funding initiatives. He brings over 15 years of experience managing executive offices and advancing institutional priorities at St. John\u2019s College, Emory University School of Law, American University, and Oregon State University. He has also worked for the higher education consulting firm Keeling &amp; Associates and in residential life at Ohio University. He has already assisted CamTech in signing an MOU with St. John\u2019s College.<\/p><p>He has a proven record of developing innovative partnerships, coordinating strategic planning initiatives, and supporting senior leadership in complex, cross-cultural settings\u2014including in Southeast Asia, where he led business development and partnership operations for a destination management company and volunteered with Global Tassels, an organization dedicated to supporting students holistically. Bruce holds a B.A. in International Studies from American University with graduate work in Southeast Asian Studies at Ohio University focused on Cambodia.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-56712b7e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"56712b7e\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2184e06b\" data-id=\"2184e06b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8f8537 elementor-widget-divide